<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Circus_equilibrium> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#description> "The exercises of balance artists consist either in keeping their body still while positioned unstably, or in maintaining stable objects stacked in an apparently fragile manner. Includes events such as Rolla Bolla, balance ball, stilts, unicycles, slackline, and tightrope." .
