<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Circus_object_manipulation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#description> "Artistic and physical practice that involves skillfully manipulating objects such as balls, clubs, or rings. It requires coordination, dexterity, and concentration, and is often performed solo or in groups as part of circus acts or street performances." .
