<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_African> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#description> "Dance combining rhythm and movement. Characterized by rites, magic, enchantment, exorcism, and the expression of freedom, morality, and various emotions. In Africa, no dance is performed without a specific purpose." .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_African> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-category-vocab/Sport> .
