<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_Kathak> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#description> "A rhythmic and energetic dance form from northern India. It represents a fusion of Hindu and Muslim cultures, characterized by powerful footwork." .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_Kathak> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-category-vocab/Sport> .
