<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_hip_hop> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/Sport> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_hip_hop> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_hip_hop> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_hip_hop> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#description> "Hip-hop culture brings together graffiti, DJing, rap, and urban dances such as breakdance, locking, and popping." .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_hip_hop> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-category-vocab/Sport> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_hip_hop> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Dance hip hop" .
