<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_jazz%2Fmodern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/Sport> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_jazz%2Fmodern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_jazz%2Fmodern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance> .
<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Dance_jazz%2Fmodern> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#description> "Dance that emphasizes torso mobility, parallel feet, stylistic individuality, and improvisation, combining sensuality, acrobatics, and dynamic expressiveness." .
